# 17. Risk Management

| Risk                            | Impact | Probability | Mitigation                                            |
| ------------------------------- | ------ | ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| Poor historical dataset quality | High   | Medium      | Data cleaning and validation                          |
| Irrelevant RAG retrieval        | High   | Medium      | Improve chunking, metadata, embeddings, and retrieval |
| LLM hallucination               | High   | Medium      | Ground outputs in retrieved evidence                  |
| Incorrect triage                | High   | Medium      | Use validation datasets and confidence scores         |
| Incorrect duplicate matching    | High   | Medium      | Evaluate Precision@K and similarity thresholds        |
| Large dataset processing time   | Medium | Medium      | Batch processing and indexing                         |
| API cost                        | Medium | Medium      | Optimize prompts and embedding calls                  |
| Agent orchestration failure     | High   | Low         | Structured state and error handling                   |
| File parsing issues             | Medium | Medium      | Support defined formats and validate uploads          |
| Insufficient test coverage      | High   | Medium      | Create test cases throughout each milestone           |

